PortareLauncher generated the derivative serial/title table on 2026-10-17,
using game name and rom.serial only. Parenthesized Rev/version labels are
removed. Multiple records with the same resulting title are collapsed. Serials
with different remaining names are omitted and listed in the build-time
psx-title-collisions.json and psp-title-collisions.json reports. Regions, language and disc labels are retained.
