The menu resolver removes parenthesized language-code groups for display only;
regions, disc labels, source DATs and exported table contents are preserved.
The derivative data retains CC-BY-SA-4.0 terms and attribution. No RetroArch
runtime, .rdb parser, online lookup or provider fallback chain is used.

