Redump's Xbox serial is the XBE certificate's title ID. Each key adds the
disc's region flags, so a title ID has up to seven rows: one per combination
of North America, Japan and the rest of the world. Region, language, revision
and packaging labels are removed. Different remaining names for a key are
omitted and recorded in xbox-title-collisions.json.
